4:["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 py-10","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-dim","children":["скил"," · ","скил"]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-2 font-display text-[clamp(22px,4vw,34px)] font-normal","children":"bff-e2e-verify-v2"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-ink-dim","children":"Этап 4 пайплайна bff-pipeline — e2e проверка новой операции против BFF Target из workspace .env. Используй всегда, когда нужно проверить, что query/mutation реально работает, прогнать GraphQL-запрос против уже живого BFF — даже если пользователь говорит просто «проверь, что отдаёт бэк». V2: проверка через bff-pipeline runner."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-dim","children":"Установка"}],["$","$Lf",null,{"command":"npx skills add egor1991egorovmac-eng/ai-agents-and-skills -g --skill bff-e2e-verify-v2"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-ink-dim","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/egor1991egorovmac-eng/ai-agents-and-skills/blob/main/skills/bff-e2e-verify-v2/SKILL.md","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","className":"text-cyan hover:underline","children":"исходник на GitHub →"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"skills/bff-e2e-verify-v2/SKILL.md"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 border-t border-white/20 pt-2","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","h1","h1-0",{"children":"BFF E2E Verify V2 — этап 4"}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["Дирижёр pipeline: ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"../bff-pipeline-v2/SKILL.md","children":"bff-pipeline-v2/SKILL.md"}]]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["Доказывает, что операция работает end-to-end: схема → резолвер → DataSource → микросервис → ответ. Цель — BFF Target (",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"BFF_PIPELINE_BFF_TARGET"}]," в workspace ",["$","code","code-1",{"children":".env"}],"), не Docker и не «всегда свой npm run dev»."]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"children":"Проверка этапа — runner (единственный источник статуса)"}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["AI ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"не"}]," интерпретирует stdout команд — только результат runner (",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"PASS"}]," / ",["$","code","code-1",{"children":"FAIL"}]," / ",["$","code","code-2",{"children":"BLOCKED"}],"). ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Не читать"}]," исходники runner (",["$","code","code-3",{"children":"scripts/"}],", ",["$","code","code-4",{"children":"scripts/lib/**"}],", ",["$","code","code-5",{"children":"*.mjs"}]," гейты, AST-чекеры, фикстуры, внутренности SPEC): только вызов CLI и компактный JSON (",["$","code","code-6",{"children":"status"}],", ",["$","code","code-7",{"children":"compact"}],", при FAIL/BLOCKED — ",["$","code","code-8",{"children":"checks"}]," и хвост ",["$","code","code-9",{"children":"logPath"}]," ~50 строк). При FAIL чинить продуктовый код по ",["$","code","code-10",{"children":"checks"}],", не открывать runner, чтобы понять гейт. Разрешено: этот SKILL.md, код bff/client, ",["$","code","code-11",{"children":"@realt-by/api-schema"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"language-bash","children":"V2=\"$HOME/.claude/skills/bff-pipeline-v2\"\nnode \"$V2/scripts/bff-pipeline.mjs\" verify --stage 4 --manifest ~/Documents/work/mls-project/manifest.json\n"}]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"PASS"}]," → сразу этап 5 (",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"client-types-sync-v2"}],")."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"FAIL"}]," → чинить код по ",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"checks"}],", повторить. Override ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"запрещён"}],". В ",["$","code","code-1",{"children":"checks[].detail"}]," должна быть ошибка из ответа, включая вложенную ошибку микроса (","$L10",": code, errorCode, message), не только общую обёртку GraphQL."]}],"\n","$L11","\n"]}],"\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e"]}]}]]}]}]
